{"id":"d039c2f88345c0e7","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-induction-stronger.md","title":"真理语言归纳扩展基础归纳","display":"cor-truth-induction-stronger — 真理语言归纳扩展基础归纳","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-induction-stronger","aliases":["91-cor-truth-induction-stronger","91-cor-induction-power","91-cor-truth-induction-strength"],"display":"cor-truth-induction-stronger — 真理语言归纳扩展基础归纳","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-induction]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]","[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-induction-stronger"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-induction-stronger</span><span>91-cor-induction-power</span><span>91-cor-truth-induction-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-induction-stronger — 真理语言归纳扩展基础归纳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础算术语言的归纳模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (含真理谓词语言的归纳模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (带全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳的标准 KF)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano 算术)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}stronger}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Ind}_T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}stronger}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式只是模式的严格句法包含：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 公式也是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 公式，而含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的实例不属于前者。第二式记录标准 KF\n中的证明论用途——对 PA\n证明长度作含真理谓词的归纳可建立全局反思，再推出 PA 一致性。</p>\n<p>不能仅凭语言包含就断言任意“正归纳、全归纳”版本构成严格证明论链；\n严格性取决于所配的真理公理、基础理论和所比较的后果语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}stronger}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["08a0ab6453addb52","09791de618b277ba","a295446296ee06c0"]}